{"id":"616387","name":"红枣米浆馒头","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/616387/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"稠大米粥","amount":"一碗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"早餐剩下来一碗大米粥。","img":"images/616387/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入搅拌机。","img":"images/616387/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"打成细腻的米浆。","img":"images/616387/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入适量发酵粉。","img":"images/616387/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅匀。","img":"images/616387/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发酵粉的米浆倒入面粉里，搅成絮状。","img":"images/616387/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉成稍软的面团，放温暖处发酵。","img":"images/616387/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"去核红枣洗一下，晾干水份，切成红枣碎。","img":"images/616387/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"面团发好了。","img":"images/616387/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"红枣碎倒发好的面团上。","img":"images/616387/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把枣揉进面团里。","img":"images/616387/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"揪成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/616387/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"揉按成窝头状。","img":"images/616387/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"揉好的馒头饧发20分钟，冷水上屉，中火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/616387/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蒸好焖4，5分钟，开盖。","img":"images/616387/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/616387/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/616387/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：搅拌机、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}